0 per branch, so $6 million was the figure that we commented on, it's kind of a full year impact, but you don't have that right out of the gate.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2018-10-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent Delie","x":"…dividend payout ratio I think when I started as CEO is closer to 80% that the strategy over time was to to grow the balance sheet organically and through acquisition take cost out, improve the profitability of the company and grow tangible book value per share and ultimately grow TCE as well.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2018/10/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"ai_spend","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"We have also built out the infrastructure necessary to expand the uses of artificial intelligence and data analytics to support our marketing efforts.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gary L. Guerrieri","x":"Despite these positive results, we are carefully monitoring the economy at large for signs of any softness, including sectors that could be adversely impacted by tariffs or the government shutdown.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"In it -- we're giving you a range because there's a lot of uncertainty not with FNB in our ability to execute with the government shutdown, tariffs, the global economy.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"As a result of our cost saving initiatives taken this year, the full year efficiency ratio was 54.8% and expenses were slightly lower on a linked quarter basis, which marks two consecutive quarters of declining run rate expenses.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2018 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2019-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"Non-interest expense is expected to be flat to down 2% compared to full year 2018, as we continue to find opportunities to take cost out of our expense base.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/01/22/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2018-earnings-conference-call-tran.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2019-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"Phase one will also incorporate machine learning tools and other technology enhancements to bring clients more tailored products and solutions, while also reducing the number of keystrokes for our customers and streamlining purchases of products and services.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2019-04-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Casey Haire","x":"I think that what we've tried to do is take cost out of the delivery channel, but we're also reinvesting in the company.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/04/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q1-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2019-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"So, those are linked together, our ability -- do to take cost out by consolidating branch locations is directly linked and having success with the lower attrition rate as directly linked to those investments and technology, so we're balancing that.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2019-07-23","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Austin Nicholas","x":"…it fair to say that, the -- at least the occupancy growth number can be -- could be relatively low -- will not be outsized given the de novo strategy, because you will continue to right size your other branches at the same time that -- it seems like you've been doing over the last few quarters?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2019-07-23","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Gary L. Guerrieri","x":"And obviously I'd say that, I think that we'll be -- Vince reaffirmed the guidance on loan growth so we feel pretty confident that we can make these changes and not impact our growth trajectory.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/07/23/fnb-corp-fnb-q2-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2019-10-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gary L. Guerrieri","x":"So, we're really focused on the economically sensitive, commodity, tariff-related segments as well as transportation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2019-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"We successfully -- we did that by doing a large acquisition, taking the cost out from that acquisition and then growing revenue over time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2019 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2019-10-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"So it's -- there is definitely opportunity there to kind of continue to reprice those and rightsize them for kind of where rates are and that's part of the yield curve, right, the longer end of the yield curve actually just gone up a few basis points of rates cut?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2019/10/17/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2019-earnings-call-transcript.aspx"},{"c":"FNB 2020 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"On the expense front, we are progressing well toward achieving our 2020 cost savings goal, reducing run rate expenses via optimizing our branch network and reducing operational costs through ongoing vendor contract renegotiations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2020 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2020-10-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"Similar to 2019 and 2020, we will, again, seek to have meaningful cost saving initiatives, building on consecutive years of taking $20 million out of our overall cost structure to support strategic investments and manage the impact of the low interest rate environment.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2020/10/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q3-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2020 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"This is evident by FNB achieving our stated 2020 cost savings floor of $20 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2020 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2021-01-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"Our commitment to reinvesting a portion of our cost savings initiatives in our digital delivery channels was instrumental in our success, serving our clients and growing loans, deposits and fee-based business.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/01/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q4-2020-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2021-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Lazzaro","x":"Diligent expense management remains a top priority, and we are on track to meet this year's $20 million cost savings target, completing our three-year $60 million expense reduction initiative.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2021-04-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Matthew Lazzaro","x":"Along with our digital investments, we continue to streamline elements of the physical delivery channel through implementing dynamic appointment setting capabilities and a comprehensive data-driven sales management platform to better identify value-added products and services when clients conduct…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/04/20/fnb-corp-fnb-q1-2021-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2021-07-20","l":"pricing_power","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Calabrese","x":"Their commodity price increases that haven't been reflected in revolver balances because they can't get the product or they're unwilling to take the risk on price volatility in the current market.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/fnb-corporation-fnb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2021-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"The quarter's efficiency ratio of 56.8% improved due to the benefit of increased revenue and continued expense discipline as we achieved the 2021 operating cost savings floor of $20 million.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/fnb-corporation-fnb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q2","e":"fnb","d":"2021-07-20","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"We view the transaction as financially attractive with a 4% EPS accretion with fully phased-in cost savings and enhanced pro forma profitability metrics, which included 200 basis point improvement in the efficiency ratio and an internal rate of return greater than 25%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/07/20/fnb-corporation-fnb-q2-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"FNB 2021 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2021-10-19","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vincent J. Delie","x":"We're going to stand up small business loans with a portal to upload information to help streamline processing.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/19/fnb-corporation-fnb-q3-2021-earnings-call-transcri/"},{"c":"FNB 2024 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2024-10-18","l":"ai_spend","r":"analyst","s":"Vince Delie","x":"…know we've been building out our risk management framework and you know we stood up an operating efficiency group for our operations area, because we felt that with the changes that are going on with AI and our investment in our data hub, we're going to be able to drive efficiency in operations.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2024 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2024-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Calabrese","x":"We continue to manage our expense base in a disciplined manner, and as we prepare our 2025 budget, we are working on a number of cost saving initiatives to bring revenue and expense growth into better balance.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2024 Q3","e":"fnb","d":"2024-10-18","l":"cost_cuts","r":"analyst","s":"Daniel Tamayo","x":"Just trying to think about right sizing, how to get to the margin number?","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q3-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2024 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2025-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Calabrese","x":"…focus on the fourth quarter's financial results, including details on the investment securities restructuring completed in November, the debt issuance and the renewable energy investment tax credit finance transaction, as well as walk you through our guidance for the first quarter and full…","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2024 Q4","e":"fnb","d":"2025-01-22","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Calabrese","x":"Fourth quarter operating net income totaled $136.7 million or $0.38 per share when excluding the $34 million pre-tax loss on the investment securities restructuring.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q4-2024-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2025 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2025-04-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gary Guerrieri","x":"Total funded provision expense for the quarter stood at $18.6 million, supporting loan growth, charge-offs not previously reserved for and a qualitative adjustment for potential tariff impacts, which I will later touch on.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2025 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2025-04-17","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Gary Guerrieri","x":"We are monitoring the current market volatility from the recently enacted tariffs and its potential impact on our loan portfolio.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2025 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2025-04-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Calabrese","x":"The average yield on the investment securities portfolio increased 3 basis points linked-quarter to 3.41% benefiting from restructuring actions taken in the fourth quarter.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/01/19/fnb-fnb-q1-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"FNB 2025 Q1","e":"fnb","d":"2025-04-17","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Vince Calabrese","x":"So and 